! source: stated (gbXML Space, the sensible part) and user (mid equipment_latent_fraction 0.1781) and user (mid equipment_radiant_fraction 0.7); gbXML: sp-conditioned; total = sensible / (1 - latent fraction); the sensible gain equals the gbXML 9.8020 W/m2; radiant fraction 0.5753 = 0.7 x (1 - 0.1781) of the design level
ElectricEquipment,
  Conditioned Zone Equipment,
  Conditioned Zone,
  sch-gains,
  Watts/Area,
  ,
  11.92602506,
  ,
  0.1781,
  0.57533,
  ;

